            "handlerName": "decide_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Record the reviewer's decision on a case in their team queue - only after the reviewer explicitly confirmed the restated decision. decision is APPROVE or REJECT; amount is the approved amount in dollars (APPROVE on a case with an amount; empty = the full eligible amount; ignored for REJECT); internal_note is required (at least 5 characters, never shown to the member); customer_message is what the member will see. Approving runs the parked action (claim payment or withdrawal) through the system's checks. Returns APPROVED / REJECTED with executed_action, or BLOCKED with reason_code NOT_YOUR_TEAM, ALREADY_DECIDED, NOTE_REQUIRED, AMOUNT_INVALID, OVER_AUTHORITY (case stays open for a senior reviewer) or NOT_FOUND, or NOT_REVIEWER. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
