        "description": "Step 1 of 2 to move money between funds inside one of the verified member&#39;s retirement accounts. Pass the account_id and from_fund_id from get_my_holdings, the to_fund_id from get_fund_catalog, and the amount in US dollars (e.g. 20000) or ALL for the whole holding. The system checks the holding and the lineup and returns PROPOSED with a proposal_id, summary and trade date (expires in 15 minutes), or BLOCKED with a reason. Nothing moves until confirm_action is called after the member explicitly says yes. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
