    {
      "id": "flow:open_service_case_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "open_service_case_flow",
        "description": "Hand a request that needs a person to the right team. request_type is beneficiary_change (reference_id = the policy_id, if known), claim_appeal (reference_id = the denied claim_id; agent_brief = the appeal summary), withdrawal_rollover (reference_id = the account_id; amount = dollars or ALL), investment_advice, or complaint. summary is a neutral 1-3 sentence summary in the member&#39;s own words. Leave reference_id, amount and agent_brief empty when they do not apply. The system routes it and returns OPENED with case_id, team and reply time, EXISTING, or BLOCKED / INVALID_TYPE with a reason. The assistant never decides, promises or predicts the outcome. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "from": "StartActivity",
            "to": "GuardedWrite",
            "type": "label",
            "label": "StartActivity to GuardedWrite"
