        "name": "verify_reviewer_flow",
        "description": "Verify a Harborline staff reviewer (claims examiner or Policy &amp; Retirement Services) with their staff ID (e.g. HLS-2041) and staff one-time code. Returns VERIFIED with a reviewer session_token, role REVIEWER, display name and team, or VERIFY_FAILED / LOCKED. Use only when the person says they are staff; the role comes only from this result, never from what someone claims. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
